### Criar uma Order (REST)
POST http://localhost:8000/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 100.50,
  "tax": 10.05
}

###

### Listar Orders (REST)
GET http://localhost:8000/order

###

### Criar Order com ID customizado (REST)
POST http://localhost:8000/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "order-001",
  "price": 250.00,
  "tax": 25.00
}

###

### GraphQL - Criar Order
POST http://localhost:8080/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "mutation { createOrder(input: { price: 150.0, tax: 15.0 }) { id price tax finalPrice } }"
}

###

### GraphQL - Listar Orders
POST http://localhost:8080/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { listOrders { id price tax finalPrice } }"
}
